  "document": "Munchkin (card game)\nMunchkin is a dedicated deck card game by Steve Jackson Games, written by Steve Jackson and illustrated by John Kovalic. It is a humorous take on role-playing games, based on the concept of munchkins (immature role-players, playing only to \"win\" by having the most powerful character possible)."
